# Ruleset: Safe Browsing
#
# Expects a proxy policy. Must precede Platforms/Apple.list, whose .apple suffix would otherwise take it.
#
# Safari's Safe Browsing service fetches its token from token.safebrowsing.apple, which fails on the direct path from the mainland but answers through a foreign exit. The Google lookups behind it already take a proxy through Platforms/Google.list.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,safebrowsing.apple
